<html><body><h1>Half-Staff Alert</h1><h2>U.S. &amp; PENNSYLVANIA FLAGS</h2><p>in Erie County</p><p>September 22, 2026 through interment (unknown)</p><p>Today, Governor Josh Shapiro ordered Commonwealth and United States flags on all Commonwealth facilities, public buildings, and grounds in Erie County to fly at half-staff in honor of Junior Firefighter Bryce Kaufmann of A.F. Dobler Hose &amp; Ladder Co., who was killed while responding to a fire on September 20, 2026.</p></body></html>
